# CapCut Inspired Android Video Maker

A polished Android video editor app inspired by CapCut's dark editor layout and AI-first workflow.

## Included
- Timeline-based editor screen
- AI studio panel
- Media library
- Preview workspace
- Material 3 dark theme
- Export action button

## Stack
- Kotlin
- Jetpack Compose
- Material 3

## Run
1. Open the project in Android Studio.
2. Let Gradle sync.
3. Select an emulator or device.
4. Run the `app` configuration.

## Note
This is an original CapCut-inspired interface prototype and not an exact clone of CapCut's proprietary software or assets.
